Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,各位空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听得见吗——？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻咻咻——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再次正式空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:25.86,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「听得见露露」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.30,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「听得见」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,米问题吧～？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:35.49,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「听得见露露——」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:40.27,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「铃原和BGM都听得见」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.29,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「好像没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.52,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「米问题～」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那么各位，再次空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的声音和…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,加上游戏的声音一起，都没问题吧～？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:03:59.77,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「米问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.82,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「音量平衡也没问题！」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:09.34,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「完美OK」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,今天玩的是这款游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,《蒲公英不屈》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来玩一玩吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.70,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「游戏声是不是时不时的卡住？」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，有点呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好像状态不太好啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，来吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，总之先试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，请稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好，稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,从头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,吼～
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,绒毛…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.96,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「露露酱要变成蒲公英吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要变成蒲公英咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,的意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…天气真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,已经要入秋了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，蒲公英是什么季节的花来着…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫们！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的小孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,呀不过要变成念旧的心态了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以前还会把绒毛吹一下玩…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对着它吹气的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.76,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英的，绒毛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:27.59,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 720 l 620 720{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:27.59,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,440)\clip(640,390,1280,720)}\N西洋蒲公英的种子落地后10到25天就会\N发芽。但如果环境不够适宜生长的话，\N也会有推迟发芽，或休眠到下一个季节\N的情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.76,AN,,0,0,0,,※西洋蒲公英与日本本土的蒲公英不为同组\N西洋蒲公英为三倍体，可不授粉直接从卵细胞发育成种子\N在中国称为药用蒲公英，被列为一般入侵物种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.61,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,籽儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:10.51,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,籽…籽是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:15.75,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,落地后10到25天就会发芽？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:19.38,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,但如果环境不够适合生长的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.01,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,…也会推迟发芽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.89,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,或休眠到下一个季节
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,…种子？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,种子！ww
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,原来还会拖到下一个季节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:37.94,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「西洋蒲公英」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.66,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「第二十天」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让人想起牵牛花的观察日记之类的东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大家也做过那种吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:54.11,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「收集两个绿球吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:59.28,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把光标对准画面上的绿球试试」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.63,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「（同时最多能拿三个）」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:07.33,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳（CO2）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:09.79,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,光合作用必需的分子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:10.98,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,由一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.05,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,碳原子…和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.25,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:19.22,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,氧原子构成…？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:23.06,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,由人类和动物的呼吸排出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:26.23,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,被植物光合作用消耗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:27.51,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在这个游戏里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:30.91,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,虽然是绿色的，但其实无色无味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,涨知识了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:39.87,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把光标移到蒲公英叶子上」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.37,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「将二氧化碳提供给蒲公英叶子」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拿过去…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.56,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「右下角的二氧化碳槽攒满了哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是教学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.07,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「看看周围的景色吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:06.64,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把光标移到画面边缘」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:10.86,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「右键就能转视角看四周哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,边缘…右键
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,光标到画面边缘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:27.53,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「切换镜头」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:28.83,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「操作方法吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.74,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「按下在左下角的」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:34.86,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「镜头操作变更按钮就能改操作方式」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:44.40,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「光标接近画面边缘时…」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,「镜头操作变更按钮旁边的滑块…」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,滑块？是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.50,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,旋转速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.50,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,用WASD也行…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——这个可能更好操作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:28.27,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把黄色的球（光能）提供给蒲公英吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:33.52,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把太阳洒下的光能收集起来，试着给蒲公英吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:37.97,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,光能…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.35,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,光合作用需要的光能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.00,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,太阳洒下来的光能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:45.49,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,是植物不可或缺的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.55,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,属于自然能源的一种
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:48.81,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,枯竭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.42,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,的可能性很低，所以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:54.18,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,也被叫做可再生能源
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:02.99,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「把蓝色的球（水）提供给蒲公英吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.88,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「环顾四周」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.84,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「收集水，然后给蒲公英吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,光、水很重要…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,水…？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个，水
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:23.17,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,光合作用需要的分子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:27.73,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,由两个氢原子和一个氧原子构成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:30.67,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,对人类和动物都很重要的水
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.93,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,对植物也必不可少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:37.12,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,可以说多亏了水，地球上才有了生命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.28,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,是我的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,画风好可爱呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是被我挡住了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要不要往左边走？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,吼……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.70,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「您能读出来就没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那个刚好有个缝隙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着钻进来了，这样如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,绝佳位置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是又挡到了就说一声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:46.22,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「你看，光合作用开始了」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:51.38,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「下面的细胞分裂槽开始积攒了」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:55.03,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「CO2和H2O」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:12:00.52,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「以及光能攒满，蒲公英就开始光合作用了」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:03.08,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「然后等槽满了」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:05.29,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「就会发生细胞分裂」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,…涨知识了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.73,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「试试细胞分裂吧！」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.88,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「CO2和H2O」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:18.37,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「以及光能，促使蒲公英光合作用」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.69,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「积攒细胞分裂槽向着细胞分裂的目标前进吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作用细胞分裂……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,光…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在光最多…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.02,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「是理科呀」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳之类的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作用什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「让它光合作用试试」那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,上过这种课吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.86,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「露露酱理科可以吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能啦——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我还挺喜欢做实验的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然喜欢实验，但不擅长……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不擅长，在名为学习的学习上真没什么拿手的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.59,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「细胞分裂」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:19.41,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,- 能看到的光能数量翻倍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:21.59,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,- 点击时的圆圈半径
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,圆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:23.72,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,变成两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:28.45,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,- 能看到的H2O的数量变成两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样的游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一点点的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就像慢慢升级那样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「斩钉截铁草」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过那个我可能挺擅长的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,家政课？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,家政课还算拿手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也算不上多拿手…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还有，体育
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,体育我擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把光增加一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吧…？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对做菜和裁缝之类的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,算是擅长的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那个水给～我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那个水…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,光球…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到的范围…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,太少了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英就是这样忍耐着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，那是什么时候来着…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要说季节的话，蒲公英…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,绒毛大概是几月…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,会开花呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在都看不到呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可能看不到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看到过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,3月到5月啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「水好少」{\r}是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,光倒是挺充足的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过等级升上去的话就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是奶奶帮我带来了水呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喷壶之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,变成两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,CO2
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，终于攒了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.67,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「水还挺稀有的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,目前好像数量不多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有水呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉能隐约看到的蓝色的是不是水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了懂了，是有时机的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶刚好…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,用喷壶把这水…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,洒下来的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,算了，要水就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.09,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英在晴天开花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:17:05.54,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 720 l 620 720{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:17:05.54,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,460)\clip(640,390,1280,720)}\N蒲公英的花在晴天绽放，而在阴天、雨\N天不开。应受光亮进行开合运动。这个\N特性有助于保护花粉不被雨滴冲走。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.85,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,阴天或雨天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:55.30,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,就不开花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.03,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,根据光照的量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:16:59.84,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,进行开合运动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.82,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,这个特性有助于
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.56,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,保护花粉不被雨滴冲走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,9月
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一整月都在下雨的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，之前说过蒲公英是3月到5月…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是那个…6月了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:24.09,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「西洋蒲公英第50天」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉叶子有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能感觉到生命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好漂亮，好美呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和封面的感觉相当…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有点落差吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,升到等级6吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,6月4日
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,12月…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不是12月，是12点21分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大白天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「休闲游{\alpha&H80&}的感觉{\alpha&H00&}」{\r}是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,拿光拿光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这次看不到二氧化碳了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,变得全是水了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有点偏科了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,CO2——
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,光也想再多要点呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,四倍……双倍啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微均衡地升一升吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,点击…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,点击范围之类好像没有来着…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:19:00.81,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「收集时按住不放也行哦，鼠标点击」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的诶…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽美丽…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，多攒点营养…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管积蓄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地好像只对附近的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有反应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作用的速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,远处那些家伙啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,想能吸到它们呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么机制…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,范围吗，圆的范围吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好浪费呀，那个吸不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话就能吸到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,再远就不行了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,点击范围变成双倍…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,数量三倍，光…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳和光也稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不，把圆圈范围弄成双倍试试…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:42.18,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「这可太惬意让人犯困了…w」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.99,0:20:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，时间也确实不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.16,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英的叶子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:21:09.00,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 720 l 620 720{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:21:09.00,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,720)}\N蒲公英的叶子有着锯齿状的独特形状。\N因为这形状像狮子的牙齿，在国外，\N蒲公英被命名为「Dandelion」。这在\N法语中意思是狮子的牙齿。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:51.47,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,有着锯齿状的独特形状
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:54.33,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,因为这形状像狮子的牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:57.84,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在国外，蒲公英被叫做Dandelion
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，Dandelion原来就是蒲公英？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在哪里听过…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:08.11,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,这在法语中意思是狮子的牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大家知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,秋天…？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.40,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,11月3日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:19.45,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,霜降
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.59,0:21:23.33,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英，第202天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,果然超花时间的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，花这么长时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,才开出花来…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点像蒲公英的叶子了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,锯齿状的呢，说起来是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然没好好观察过…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,见光范围三倍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,收光收光…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,刚觉得怎么这么暗，原来才15点21分…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的秋夜长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,确实渐渐…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,已经进入10月了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.55,0:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢变冷了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,往后太阳会落得越来越早吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:51.08,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,- 点击时圆的范围三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.23,0:22:55.51,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,- 能同时回收的分子和光增到6个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.79,0:22:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，现在能同时吸收的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,…分子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很少吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,升到6个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.87,0:23:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,刚还想着怎么完全吸不到，原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,第二
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,第三
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,第六
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,变全红就表示再也吸不了了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,…10！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，这个不是很关键吗？能吸的分子的量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.43,0:23:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「终于发现了」{\r}发现啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,冬天为了抵御严寒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:57.05,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 920 l 620 920{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:57.05,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N冬天，为了抵御严寒保护自身，蒲公英\N会以被称为「莲座状」的形态越冬，\N叶片紧贴地面呈放射状散开。这种状态\N能够避开冷风，利用地热高效地吸收\N阳光，且无需拔高茎干，从而节省能量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把叶子紧贴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.82,0:23:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到地面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,以放射状展开，用名为「莲座状」的形态
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,度过冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这种状态能避开冷风
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,利用地热高效吸收阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,无需拔高茎干，从而得以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,节省能量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:23:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莲座状
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.26,0:24:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,冬天啦～
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:09.33,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,1月22日 大寒\N六花
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.79,0:24:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,被埋在雪里了…超漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.76,0:24:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,变得相当容易回收了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.93,0:24:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉……BGM是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是《雪やこんこ》吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「雪呀下吧下吧……」不是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,霰呀下吧下吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.73,0:24:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉微妙的有点不够
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在冰天雪地之中……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.57,0:25:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊，蒲公英……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.59,0:25:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是蒲公英……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,生命真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,15……嗯……哪边更好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.90,0:25:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不，先选15吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,9、10、11、12……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,15……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦——好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,变成三倍，四倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.48,0:25:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉二氧化碳好像有点少
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.37,0:25:46.93,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「在自然界过冬的强大本领啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.95,0:25:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:53.78,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英的花其实是一两百朵小花聚在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:27:14.46,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 920 l 620 920{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:27:14.46,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N蒲公英的一朵花，实际上是由100~200\N朵小花聚集而成，看起来就像是一朵\N大花。此外，西洋蒲公英和日本蒲公英\N区别之一，在于花根部的总苞片形状。\N西洋蒲公英外侧的总苞片向下翻卷，而\N日本蒲公英的总苞片则是朝上并向内侧\N贴合。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:55.80,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,看起来就像一朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗……？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.32,0:26:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有那么多……？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.07,0:26:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是说集合体吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:08.84,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,还有，西洋蒲公英和日本蒲公英的区别是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.95,0:26:10.51,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在于花根部
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,总什么片……？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.79,0:26:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,总…不是钉，应该读什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,总什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.33,0:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,片？的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.78,0:26:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么片啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.93,0:26:25.68,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「密集恐惧症」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不怕密集，不过也不算完全吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太夸张的那种还是会「哦～」一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.80,0:26:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也没到那种程度……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.27,0:26:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没到恐惧症的地步呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～用显微镜看会很厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.09,0:26:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总苞片？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.45,0:26:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是总苞片
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.81,0:26:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,自然真的很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好像叫总苞片
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.27,0:26:57.71,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「血源的眼睛吓人」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:27:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……因为是眼珠，才会这么觉得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:05.66,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在于总苞片的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.84,0:27:10.40,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英外侧的总苞片向下翻折……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:14.46,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,日本蒲公英则朝上并向内侧贴合
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.85,0:27:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.81,0:27:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，西洋蒲公英和……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.91,0:27:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,日本蒲公英……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.22,0:27:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,都不知道还有这种区别
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.43,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为蒲公英就是蒲公英呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.47,0:27:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，4月5日
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哇——！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.02,0:27:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,长成漂亮的蒲公英了……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不错呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.38,0:27:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这个BGM是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.31,0:27:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听过
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.62,0:27:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么来着……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.42,0:27:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,和四月的那首……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是那首曲子…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:27:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……是《春天来啦》啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「春天来了，春天来了，来到了哪里？」的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,20！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这种一次能捡好几个的，好爽……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.72,0:28:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.54,0:28:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样蒲公英的花……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.43,0:28:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就开花了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,话说一两百朵聚在一起，还真厉害啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.31,0:28:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳有点太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍啦——
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是连信长都惊讶的圆的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.38,0:28:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,四倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.89,0:29:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,H2O有点不够……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.73,0:29:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,得去看看奶奶那边
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,？！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.52,0:29:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你好——早上好——
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.29,0:29:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，等、危险……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.31,0:29:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不在不在，哇——
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.49,0:29:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这不弄哭了嘛ww
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.75,0:29:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是用来逗笑的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.55,0:29:39.23,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「忍耐。」\N玩法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:42.63,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「按住左键就能忍耐」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:45.26,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「没进行忍耐时对方的攻击{\alpha&H80&}命中时会造成大伤害{\r}」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,攻、攻击？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉突然变成别的游戏了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.41,0:29:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.90,0:29:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,按住左键的时候忍耐……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.19,0:29:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.97,0:29:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没在忍耐时受到攻击就是大伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.73,0:30:02.65,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「配合攻击时机忍耐就能弹反」！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.73,0:30:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,弹、弹反…！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,流向改变力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.03,0:30:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,OK，忍耐……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.07,0:30:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,忍…！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.25,0:30:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.82,0:30:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,忍…！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.85,0:30:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.84,0:30:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,奶嘴……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.37,0:30:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，忍…！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.89,0:30:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚好忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.89,0:30:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,到底带了多少个奶嘴啊…ww
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.53,0:30:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,当妈妈真不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.78,0:30:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哇啊哇啊哇……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.43,0:30:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈可能很辛苦，但我这边也很辛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.06,0:30:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,自然界也有这种危险呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.13,0:30:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对了！个鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.01,0:30:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,鸭子和……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.29,0:30:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.57,0:30:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当～
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.19,0:31:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这音游…？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.02,0:31:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿～嘿～
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.79,0:31:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等…忍耐值…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要朝花扔呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.47,0:31:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人类……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.39,0:31:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.09,0:31:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐住了……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.48,0:31:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哇——
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.17,0:31:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.31,0:31:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不收拾一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说哄孩子各种事也很辛苦吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没收拾就那么回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.55,0:31:38.05,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英绒毛的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.55,0:31:58.00,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 920 l 620 920{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.55,0:31:58.00,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N蒲公英绒毛的真面目，是附着在\N种子上的、被称为「冠毛」的白色细毛。\N每一粒种子上大约长有100根细毛，\N空气从这些细毛之间穿过时，会产生\N特殊的空气涡流，从而使其能够稳定地\N飞行。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.18,0:31:39.76,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,是附着在种子上的？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.99,0:31:41.15,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,冠毛…？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.17,0:31:42.92,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,被称为冠毛的白色细毛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.88,0:31:47.79,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,一粒种子约有{\rDefault}一千根细毛……{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.81,0:31:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，零加多了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.38,0:31:51.74,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,一百根
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:56.10,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,空气穿过细毛之间时会产生特殊的空气涡流
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.13,0:31:58.16,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,从而能够稳定的飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.12,0:32:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让我有点想用显微镜什么的看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.36,0:32:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这种毛，意外地……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,凑得很近看的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的种子，90……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.05,0:32:20.03,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H80&}MISSION{\r}\N让蒲公英种子乘风飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.06,0:32:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.74,0:32:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.02,0:32:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.17,0:32:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞呢——……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.18,0:32:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.69,0:32:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞在飞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.27,0:32:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇——
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.02,0:32:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,绒毛～
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.00,0:32:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.70,0:33:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有种怀念的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.94,0:33:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧——
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.17,0:33:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那种，真的是小学的时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.84,0:33:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,路边长着，一吹的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.59,0:33:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就那么飞走了，这种记忆……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.13,0:33:21.52,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,偶尔会出现大分子和光球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:36.00,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 920 l 620 920{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:36.00,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N条件允许时，西洋蒲公英的种子可以飞\N1km左右。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.09,0:33:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,种子……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.32,0:33:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,条件好的话能飞约1公里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.34,0:33:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,1公里……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,飞走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,肥皂泡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:58.17,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,4月5日 清明\N肥皂泡与电车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.37,0:34:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，又来到麻烦的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.78,0:34:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,第二十天
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.81,0:34:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，又……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.94,0:34:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,养大之后……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.28,0:34:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,先把等级……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.13,0:34:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，刚才好像有泡泡……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.26,0:34:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡像水一样……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作…看得见的光能……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，可能点错了，二氧化碳现在最多……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，有几个都无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.60,0:34:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,水也是，给太多大概也不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.56,0:34:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.79,0:34:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害的光……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.35,0:34:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,…球…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.90,0:35:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,变成好大的元气弹一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.47,0:35:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡姑且算是失误判定还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.54,0:35:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为好像用了洗涤剂之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.04,0:35:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得对植物不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,比起光，还是这边…？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.69,0:35:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？好大的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.05,0:35:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害的…光的颗粒超大
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.52,0:35:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把力量分给我…！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.73,0:35:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,H2O…15…点击时的圆扩大2倍
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.70,0:35:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,先调成2倍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.95,0:35:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是洗涤剂的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.66,0:35:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,会那个吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:03.01,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80}总之因为是洗涤剂，{\r}直接大量浇到土里，植物会死掉」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.28,0:36:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,日本除了西洋蒲公英还有……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:35.00,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 920 l 620 920{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:35.00,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N日本除了西洋蒲公英以外，还有关东蒲\N公英、关西蒲公英、虾夷蒲公英等各种\N各样的品种在各地分布。\N另外还有外来蒲公英和本土蒲公英杂交\N诞生的蒲公英。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.63,0:36:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,关东蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.82,0:36:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,关西蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,虾…夷蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.49,0:36:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等各种种类在各地……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.81,0:36:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,分……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,布…？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.74,0:36:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.65,0:36:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还有外来蒲公英和
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.47,0:36:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,本土蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杂交诞生的蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嚯……？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.35,0:36:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.11,0:36:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英竟然有这么多……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.24,0:36:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.77,0:36:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,能吸好多水分……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.58,0:36:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,第66天，5月21日
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.32,0:36:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写着「Big」呢，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「Big」是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.26,0:37:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雨声是不是超棒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.66,0:37:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,呀，好惬意啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.44,0:37:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,开在这种地方的蒲公英，其实也……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.23,0:37:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就算这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.29,0:37:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,开花其实是挺不容易的吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.03,0:37:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但自然界意外地……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.37,0:37:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不管什么环境……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.10,0:37:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都在坚强地活着吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,光有点少吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.87,0:37:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大概也会有枯掉的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.55,0:37:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是意外地……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.91,0:37:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,挺坚强的吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，光也好好的收集到了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.42,0:38:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.98,0:38:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让光翻三倍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.79,0:38:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,聚集吧…！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说我之前说最近完全没看到蒲公英，但其实……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.22,0:38:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是变得不会注意到它们开花了…？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.46,0:38:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,…我开始这么觉得了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.31,0:38:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，总觉得——
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,和小学时看东西的视角相比…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.31,0:38:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看事物的眼光，真是变了，我这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.81,0:38:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,路边开的花之类的……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.46,0:38:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,水沟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.33,0:38:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,之类的……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.50,0:38:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,都不看了……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.08,0:38:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.25,0:38:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也许真的变成这样了呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.46,0:38:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是怎样呢，普通的，那个，单纯地……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.85,0:39:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的就是没长出来……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.73,0:39:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也有这种可能就是了……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.58,0:39:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但也可能是我没留意呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还是增加到15吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.51,0:39:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,难道这就是长大成人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.59,0:39:21.19,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英即使遇上强风，也必须呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.24,0:39:23.68,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,进行光合作用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.59,0:39:24.59,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,40)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 880 l 620 880{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.59,0:39:24.59,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,450)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N蒲公英即使遇上强风，也必须呼吸、\N进行光合作用。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.85,0:39:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.93,0:39:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,强、强风…？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.41,0:39:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,台风？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.63,0:39:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,7月7日
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.77,0:39:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,ww怎么像是在抽烟一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.16,0:39:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.42,0:39:42.07,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H80&}MISSION{\r}\N升到等级9吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.48,0:39:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,风确实很大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.22,0:39:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不输给雨，也不输给风……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.12,0:39:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.59,0:39:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不过……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.43,0:39:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.01,0:40:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.50,0:40:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,…多亏了它，我才能把水……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.41,0:40:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.25,0:40:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,无论什么强风
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.88,0:40:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能怠慢摄取营养哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,…果然，自然界真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.77,0:40:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛，人类也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.06,0:40:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如此呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.79,0:40:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,20……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.44,0:40:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,四倍
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.66,0:40:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,H…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,2O再增加一点也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.40,0:40:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,加油，快长大吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.86,0:40:47.96,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80&}我也{\r}想靠光合作用活下去」
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作用重要～
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.46,0:40:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,人类也需要光、水……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.10,0:40:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,氧气
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,…没有就活不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.57,0:41:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍、两倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.38,0:41:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,范围三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.84,0:41:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.26,0:41:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,圆会想把它调大，果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.82,0:41:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.79,0:41:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不错呢，不过变得更好收集了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.40,0:41:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说范围是不错……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.01,0:41:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,数量要不要再多一点呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.42,0:41:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过20个也攒不了那么多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.21,0:41:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好大，还能调到四倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过光合作用的速度也可以调快点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.07,0:41:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,三倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.86,0:41:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.95,0:41:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,水好像有点少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.81,0:41:50.64,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.81,0:42:28.81,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,-19)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 880 l 620 880{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.81,0:42:28.81,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,380)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N西洋蒲公英即使不授粉也能结出种子。\N也就是说，它能够进行无融合生殖。\N凭借其强大的繁殖能力，以城市地区为\N中心，日本本土的蒲公英曾一度看起来\N像是被外来物种西洋蒲公英驱逐了。\N但实际上，据说它们是在城市和郊区\N形成了栖息地分化。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.41,0:41:53.98,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,不用授粉也能结出种子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.52,0:41:58.81,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,能结出种子，也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:00.07,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,单……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.77,0:42:01.41,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,…为…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.45,0:42:02.25,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,生……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.51,0:42:05.23,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,…殖是能够进行的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.54,0:42:08.51,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,凭借强大的繁殖力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.82,0:42:09.73,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,城市……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:12.18,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,以市区为中心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.34,0:42:14.98,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,日本的外来种蒲公英……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.02,0:42:17.64,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,被身为外来种的西洋蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.32,0:42:21.18,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,看起来像是被驱逐了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.29,0:42:23.47,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,但实际的情况是……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:25.18,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在城市和郊…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:28.80,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,外形成了栖息地分化
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.32,0:42:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,吼～？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.35,0:42:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊，8月23日……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.00,0:42:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真长知识
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.48,0:42:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地…与其说意外不如说完全不了解呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.85,0:42:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英的事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.43,0:42:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮呀——
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:42:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过果然好可爱呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.06,0:42:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.86,0:42:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个还挺……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.56,0:43:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,叶子也是，就像刚才说的……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,相当多的……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.70,0:43:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一两百颗哼一下压缩在一起嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.01,0:43:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.11,0:43:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有密集恐惧症的人，还是会有点……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.62,0:43:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,会「呃」地一下难受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.55,0:43:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.60,0:43:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个应该不会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不放大看就没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.59,0:43:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,回头我也把
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.98,0:43:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.07,0:43:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,放大，用那种方式……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.13,0:43:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,调查一下看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.17,0:43:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.76,0:43:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.33,0:43:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有「哇——」一下的感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.95,0:43:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只要不是疙疙瘩瘩的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.70,0:43:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那种排列就没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.21,0:43:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，有点让人犯怵……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.70,0:43:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,的集合体…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.69,0:43:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.74,0:44:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这么说来，我对蜘蛛那种……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.49,0:44:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多眼球的感觉就是「呃」的一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.15,0:44:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,光能…光四…三倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.25,0:44:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,先选三倍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.69,0:44:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.61,0:44:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,四倍、四倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.39,0:44:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这也三倍……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.96,0:44:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,光合作用……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.22,0:44:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.12,0:44:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.61,0:44:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,过来……不对不能叫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.93,0:44:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在对我来说是天敌吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.85,0:44:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英铃原
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.61,0:44:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不惧雨，不惧风，要输给猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.34,0:44:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.49,0:45:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱——
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.49,0:45:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,光剪影就好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.12,0:45:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，胡须……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.23,0:45:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会「嘿、嘿」地挥爪呀……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.36,0:45:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,猫进状态了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.69,0:45:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好可爱——
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会在意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.04,0:45:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.50,0:45:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,……嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.73,0:45:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.05,0:45:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,各种意义上都要忍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.90,0:45:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱，滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.45,0:45:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.38,0:45:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.01,0:45:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐…！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.18,0:45:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要忍住
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.48,0:45:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要忍住啊我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.53,0:45:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚有忍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.18,0:45:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,风…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.51,0:45:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不行，进了狩猎模式……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.74,0:46:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还请住手啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.36,0:46:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哼！啊痛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.14,0:46:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛好痛好痛好痛，没想到……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,挺难顶哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.91,0:46:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,咕……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.86,0:46:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.91,0:46:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐力已经……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.37,0:46:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.00,0:46:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.16,0:46:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英它……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.49,0:46:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没能忍住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.33,0:46:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,诶等等，猫好强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.84,0:46:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.92,0:46:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真的输给猫了……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.20,0:46:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.16,0:46:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.97,0:46:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.94,0:46:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.95,0:46:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.04,0:46:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有点羡慕，不过其实挺疼的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.53,0:46:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在玩耍的延长线上，我也被猫猫打了好几次……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.27,0:47:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,被爪子挠过好多回了……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的相当疼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.35,0:47:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还有踩奶这回事……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.95,0:47:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在膝盖上踩时会伸爪，所以很疼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.35,0:47:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是有攻击力的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.06,0:47:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.19,0:47:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还是想达成
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.71,0:47:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.69,0:47:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,时机正好……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.32,0:47:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.47,0:47:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.23,0:47:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,目标换成蝴蝶了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.07,0:47:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.48,0:47:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,痛痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.12,0:47:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，可能有点难……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.54,0:47:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，补充水分
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.27,0:48:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,完全弹反不了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.52,0:48:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是FS游啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.09,0:48:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.63,0:48:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.79,0:48:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,……嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.56,0:48:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.80,0:48:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.71,0:48:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.77,0:48:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,咕…忍不住
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.10,0:48:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,起风了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.28,0:48:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开关打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.88,0:48:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.64,0:48:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.87,0:48:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.59,0:48:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:48:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.14,0:48:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.55,0:49:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.88,0:49:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.12,0:49:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.25,0:49:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.87,0:49:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛，好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.37,0:49:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.43,0:49:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.04,0:49:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……勉强一半
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.37,0:49:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好好啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.88,0:49:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.22,0:49:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不过一直按住会不会更好…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.52,0:49:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.76,0:49:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好难……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.04,0:49:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好难，忍耐不住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.19,0:49:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对猫果然还是……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.94,0:49:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「能打出精准防反就好了，真难」{\r}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.43,0:49:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.31,0:49:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.29,0:49:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.48,0:49:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.37,0:49:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.87,0:50:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好的好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.09,0:50:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,野生的蒲公英真不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.49,0:50:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,像逗猫棒那种……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.27,0:50:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,效果现在……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.80,0:50:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.78,0:50:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.21,0:50:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.17,0:50:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫拳…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.74,0:50:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微适应了一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.44,0:50:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大意不得，大意不得
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.71,0:50:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好……还算可以还算可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.15,0:50:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿、嘿、嘿、嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿、嘿、嘿、嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.29,0:51:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.31,0:51:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,！危险
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.11,0:51:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.39,0:51:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,呼……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.80,0:51:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,另一种意义上捏了把汗——
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.31,0:51:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我说，别在这附近玩呀，猫猫——
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.98,0:51:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太危险了。仔细想想，这里是铁轨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.22,0:51:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,猫…啊，突然出现猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.22,0:53:35.72,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,-19)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 880 l 620 880{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.22,0:53:35.72,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,380)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N人们普遍认为，猫在2100年前的弥生\N时代就已经存在于日本了。此外，据说\N在16世纪后半叶的安土桃山时代，由于\N老鼠造成的危害日益严重，政府颁布了\N「猫放养令」，自这项法令颁布以后，\N猫散养的习惯便开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.03,0:51:28.90,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.94,0:51:31.23,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,在2100年前的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.71,0:51:34.09,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,弥生时代就已经
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.23,0:51:37.40,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,被认为早就存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.58,0:51:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,聊到猫，我想起一件事，前阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.78,0:51:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,时隔一百年新品种的猫猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.78,0:51:49.53,AN,,0,0,0,,※蒂尔卡约虎猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.79,0:51:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,诞生的新闻，看到这种觉得特别暖心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.75,0:51:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我记忆犹新呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.48,0:51:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大家知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.58,0:51:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.75,0:51:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小小的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:51:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,带花纹的猫猫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.32,0:52:02.64,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「原来有这种事」「这样啊，我都不知道」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.82,0:52:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，是吗是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.44,0:52:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,小小的猫猫……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.40,0:52:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对超可爱……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.11,0:52:15.51,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「第一次知道」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.55,0:52:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「真的吗？」{\r}是的，很厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.39,0:52:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.17,0:52:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,新品种
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.93,0:52:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪儿发现的有点忘了……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.36,0:52:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,其实真有这样的新闻哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.48,0:52:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，还挺……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.71,0:52:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大概一两周前，我的日期感……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.55,0:52:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很不靠谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对，有点像豹纹的那种……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.78,0:52:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,…超可爱的猫猫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.55,0:52:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,像孟加拉猫那种丛林系的……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.20,0:52:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧，还有我们不知道的猫猫…猫猫品种们…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.20,0:52:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一定还有很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.92,0:53:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,时隔一百年，还真厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.21,0:53:06.31,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,就已经存在于日本了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.40,0:53:08.60,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,此外，在16世纪后半
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:13.80,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,安土桃山时代，鼠害日益严重
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.95,0:53:17.37,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,于是颁布了「猫放养令」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.65,0:53:21.83,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,自这项法令颁布以后，猫散养的习惯便开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.04,0:53:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.38,0:53:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害猫……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.23,0:53:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.24,0:53:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,2100年前…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.64,0:53:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,猫也是有历史的……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.70,0:53:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,放养啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.71,0:53:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像是在放养着的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.77,0:53:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,果然附近都会有一些嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.13,0:53:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,会担心起来呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.64,0:53:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是我有点太过保护了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.97,0:54:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对猫来说呢，能自由自在——
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.21,0:54:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样过想必比较舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.63,0:54:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该是最棒的……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.06,0:54:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但总是不在视线里就会担心
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.19,0:54:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.10,0:54:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.25,0:54:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心猫哦，绒毛们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.45,0:54:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被吃掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.61,0:54:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候我常幻想，西瓜籽也是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.80,0:54:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,绒毛的种子要是吃下去……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.13,0:54:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在胃里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.12,0:54:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,种子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.90,0:54:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.87,0:54:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,种子就发芽了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.61,0:54:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会开花，你们想过吗？只有我？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.97,0:54:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,西瓜籽要是吞下去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.34,0:54:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在胃里……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.61,0:54:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会在里面长出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.85,0:55:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,然后突然就害怕起来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.90,0:55:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有过的吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.38,0:55:11.35,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「确实想过呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.38,0:55:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧那种吓人的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.75,0:55:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「小学时代常有的事」{\r}对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.68,0:55:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.60,0:55:23.91,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.60,0:55:47.60,MASK,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1\1c&H000000&\1a&H00&}m 620 440 l 1280 440 l 1280 880 l 620 880{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.60,0:55:47.60,REPLACE,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,420)\clip(640,390,1280,1020)}\N蒲公英能存活数年，视情况甚至可达到\N10年以上。在其生命周期中，会多次\N开花，让绒毛飞散。飞撒的绒毛会再次\N扎根开花，飞撒绒毛。蒲公英就是这样\N循环往复。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.99,0:55:26.19,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,能存活数年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.38,0:55:29.85,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,视情况甚至可达到10年以上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.06,0:55:33.20,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,期间会多次开花、飞撒绒毛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.27,0:55:36.24,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,飞撒的绒毛会再次扎根
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.28,0:55:39.79,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,就这样再开花、再飞撒绒毛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.03,0:55:42.36,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,蒲公英就这样循环往复
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.79,0:55:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不断轮回着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.28,0:55:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,话说它挺长寿的，十年以上……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.23,0:55:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为很短呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.44,0:55:52.89,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「蒲公英轮回。」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.47,0:55:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧，还真长寿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:56:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,十年以上啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.10,0:56:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在这么残酷的自然界活十年……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.06,0:56:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然真残酷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.13,0:56:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.15,0:56:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是线香烟花！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.94,0:56:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真有风情
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.43,0:56:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,二氧化碳好多
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.23,0:56:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,乘着风……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.06,0:56:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不怕雨……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.36,0:56:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也不惧火
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.12,0:56:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,打雷了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.51,0:56:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我很喜欢雷声和雨声呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.10,0:56:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,开了——
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.86,0:56:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，就这样轮回下去啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.07,0:57:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,生命的奇妙之处
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.83,0:57:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,飞走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.13,0:57:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这朵绒毛也，带着许多……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.62,0:57:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,又让新芽……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.84,0:57:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,代代轮回下去呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.71,0:57:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,…冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.58,0:57:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只有款冬花茎之类的，在整个冬天……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.65,0:57:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,默默忍耐，到春天才开花……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.38,0:57:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,…是夏天吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.62,0:57:45.64,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「这么一看，真是坚强」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.66,0:57:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.97,0:57:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感受到生命的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.64,0:57:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,樱花——
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.29,0:57:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,毕业典礼……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.59,0:58:00.12,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「3月9日」
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.31,0:58:01.89,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「惊蛰」
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.10,0:58:03.68,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「终点与起点」
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:07.59,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英\N从那之后十年
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.72,0:58:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,十年间
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.41,0:58:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不过反而开始好奇它会怎么结束
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.24,0:58:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样轮回着……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英的终点……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.25,0:58:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.04,0:58:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,十年之后会怎么到来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.73,0:58:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,毕业典礼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.15,0:58:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,话说这……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.07,0:58:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子，难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.44,0:58:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小时ho……啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.57,0:58:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了！快忍耐！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.21,0:58:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.76,0:58:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.70,0:59:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.20,0:59:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走向终结……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.86,0:59:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然心酸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.74,0:59:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过又会轮回下去呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,绒毛又变成种子……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.19,0:59:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,然后开花
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.38,0:59:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.33,0:59:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,生命就是这样轮回的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.86,0:59:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,《轮回。》OPED曲……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.32,0:59:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,太感人了……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.40,1:00:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.66,1:00:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.01,1:00:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才也说过
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.87,1:00:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,长大以后，好多东西都看不见了啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.55,1:00:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，重新……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.06,1:00:15.56,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,「季节轮回……」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微让人换个角度看事物……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.38,1:00:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住去思考呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.59,1:00:25.38,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,1月23日\N大寒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.98,1:00:28.94,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,西洋蒲公英\N第十年
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.25,1:00:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.75,1:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.21,1:00:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,…？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.19,1:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.02,1:00:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,糟…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.60,1:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了！忍耐
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.34,1:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.83,1:00:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,霹雳……舞？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.37,1:00:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉氛围又变了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.01,1:01:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不能止步于感动！忍住！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.11,1:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊痛！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.80,1:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,踢！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.16,1:01:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.51,1:01:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,住、住、住手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.01,1:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.31,1:01:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别、别、别…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.74,1:01:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.02,1:01:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别、别、别、别、别……
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.12,1:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停住，痛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.43,1:01:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.68,1:01:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.91,1:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.13,1:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.40,1:01:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停手啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.73,1:01:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,恶意
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.30,1:01:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等一…下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.04,1:01:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这种真忍不了，不是蒲公英也忍不了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.39,1:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只有恶意吧这位
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.12,1:01:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「扇耳光就不一样了吧ww」{\r}是啊ww
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.91,1:01:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.60,1:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.34,1:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.18,1:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,痛…好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.51,1:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.51,1:01:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，够痛，可能痛过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.55,1:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等……再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.86,1:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,伤害…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,凶残
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.69,1:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手，警察同志就是这人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.97,1:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,大冬天干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.88,1:02:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.05,1:02:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.21,1:02:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.45,1:02:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.64,1:02:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.33,1:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,歹——
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.65,1:02:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没死，没事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.68,1:02:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是打中不该打的怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.75,1:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是冬天该干……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.70,1:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不说冬天，不该在外面干吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.45,1:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,两连打好痛…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.15,1:03:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再来再来再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.46,1:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.94,1:03:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.67,1:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.95,1:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.69,1:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,疼疼疼疼，诶诶诶…？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.10,1:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等下，可能超级痛…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.74,1:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是说时机不对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反不了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.77,1:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,明明在FS游…在白银周中练过了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.28,1:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,完全…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,咚…疼疼疼…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.70,1:04:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.36,1:04:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.85,1:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.04,1:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.29,1:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.61,1:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚…诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.88,1:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,唔…呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.99,1:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咚……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.29,1:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.51,1:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.73,1:04:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.01,1:04:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.23,1:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿……住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.37,1:04:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,头……啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.79,1:04:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这还得绕一圈啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.32,1:04:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊好痛……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.14,1:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,咕…！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.65,1:04:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,咕……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.73,1:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔也在轮着回啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.29,1:04:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.79,1:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.28,1:05:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.55,1:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.79,1:05:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.03,1:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.22,1:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.57,1:05:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.75,1:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.78,1:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛——
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.66,1:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反不了可不行…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.37,1:05:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,又一轮了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.58,1:05:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,疼…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.17,1:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.79,1:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再……来！再来再来再来再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「和蒲公英有什么仇啊这个大叔」{\r}真的是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,明确的…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.47,1:05:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,杀意
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.32,1:06:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.39,1:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说太早了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.43,1:06:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.63,1:06:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,呀——完全忍不了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.41,1:06:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么弹反不了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.48,1:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛好痛好痛好……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,痛！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.21,1:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,呃是节奏问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.00,1:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得得得嘿，这节奏好怪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.32,1:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.41,1:06:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.88,1:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.78,1:06:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为何，为何
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.27,1:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是晚了还是早了都搞不清
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.22,1:07:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，为什么为什么，为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.07,1:07:11.52,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「不如说，可能也许不看动作反而更好」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.46,1:07:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，听声音？靠听声音可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.07,1:07:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,( {\b1}{\i1}#{\i0}{\b0} ｀∀´) 
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.10,1:07:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬弹反到了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.63,1:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好…痛——
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.67,1:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来是打算靠节奏去弹的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.48,1:07:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,发光的瞬间？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.17,1:07:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.20,1:08:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,发光的瞬间对吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.29,1:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？亮了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.70,1:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.28,1:08:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.48,1:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.97,1:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.24,1:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.37,1:08:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,亮了的……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.39,1:08:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,…时机……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.88,1:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，一直按着行吗？……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.40,1:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,霹雳舞时不亮？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.34,1:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是亮了之后再按
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.28,1:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.58,1:09:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.47,1:09:04.10,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「是有延迟什么的吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.13,1:09:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.09,1:09:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是用显示器在玩…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.72,1:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.37,1:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还是弹不到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.35,1:09:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐的……盾标识出现之后……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.51,1:09:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,盾标识是……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.81,1:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是我按下去的时候……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.17,1:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.73,1:09:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,完全混乱……毫无头绪……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.53,1:09:55.17,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「比一心大人强」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.17,1:09:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,长按？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.95,1:10:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一直按着吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.41,1:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，但一直按着会掉体力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.14,1:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一直按住不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.22,1:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬间，就有一瞬间按到
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.21,1:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像一瞬间按到了，时机完全搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.98,1:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,过于强敌了爷……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.76,1:11:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不是爷爷，大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.62,1:11:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这个时机？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.88,1:11:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊痛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.94,1:11:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,呀……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.19,1:11:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是说被疯狂打中呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.68,1:11:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.38,1:11:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反了不少下呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.99,1:11:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.97,1:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要来力
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.85,1:11:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，再来再来再来再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.39,1:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.28,1:12:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才居然意外地弹到了……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.70,1:12:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.30,1:12:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.97,1:12:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上节奏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.59,1:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,来了…！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.64,1:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,咕……忍不住
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.03,1:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「在拍鼠标」{\r}在拍在拍，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.65,1:13:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好好跟着……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.12,1:13:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,节奏去拍
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.44,1:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.56,1:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.96,1:13:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咕……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.37,1:13:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越熟练了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.96,1:13:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等ww
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.69,1:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第二轮节奏搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.78,1:14:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,第一轮好像有点头绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.82,1:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.98,1:14:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好好，不错不错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.09,1:14:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——也许渣操了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.47,1:14:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,第二轮还没撑过，第二轮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.90,1:14:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始……
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.19,1:14:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.73,1:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不懂啊——第二轮二阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.87,1:15:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,二阶段好难啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.89,1:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一阶段……感觉懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.15,1:15:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.30,1:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,总算是……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:02.19,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「旋转踢的时候一直按住按钮如何」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,二……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.12,1:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,第二轮的时机完全不一样……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.22,1:16:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的就像BOSS的二阶段一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.51,1:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里搞明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.38,1:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,诶痛——
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.75,1:17:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,……好好，还剩一半
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.78,1:17:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪——
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.43,1:17:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪——时机在哪——
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一二一二……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.09,1:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.04,1:17:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一二二二
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.47,1:17:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.00,1:17:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么……？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.57,1:17:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,连一阶段的时机也开始抓不准了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.09,1:18:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.83,1:18:24.97,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「喝口水歇一下？w」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.95,1:18:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喝口吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.51,1:18:34.02,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「有好好按按钮吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.01,1:18:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.24,1:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.49,1:18:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.64,1:18:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,果然……用力点按更好？难道说
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.08,1:19:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,用力按，好像会有反应
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.98,1:19:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是要提前按……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.50,1:19:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶跟力度有关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.75,1:19:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,咕……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.37,1:19:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉跟按的轻重有关
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.98,1:19:26.08,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「感觉要坏了」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.33,1:19:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,强弱真的会有区别吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.89,1:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.47,1:19:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好好感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.73,1:20:06.52,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「也有说诀窍是狠狠敲的主播呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.56,1:20:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,果然啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.92,1:20:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得那样比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.50,1:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,唔——
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.91,1:20:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微提前一点也许行
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.03,1:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微早一点试试？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.43,1:20:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的时机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.14,1:20:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,？！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.22,1:20:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行呢，是太晚了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.75,1:20:54.55,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「按太用力鼠标要坏掉了」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.31,1:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,以不会按坏的力量按吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.30,1:21:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮～
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.36,1:21:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反弹反～
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.16,1:21:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「回血好爽」{\r}是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.50,1:21:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.42,1:22:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,咕——好可惜——
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.79,1:22:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜重来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能按到的地方多弹反
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.37,1:22:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不错呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.62,1:22:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛……
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.83,1:22:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好…！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.66,1:22:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.97,1:22:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是一点点习惯了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.13,1:22:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是真的难的第二形态…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.54,1:22:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,第一形态已经勉强感觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.15,1:22:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有点搞明白了……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.91,1:23:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.62,1:23:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好……痛
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.37,1:23:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样，打倒了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.98,1:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好！干得漂亮，蒲公英！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.15,1:23:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,超强啊——大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.35,1:23:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，没收…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.84,1:23:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss、BossRush追加…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:58.85,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,连续忍耐住宝宝、猫、上班族
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.02,1:24:02.15,GAME_TEXT,,0,0,0,,继承的体力会保留，要注意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.89,1:24:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.95,1:24:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真的像只狼一样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.97,1:24:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好……试试看！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.55,1:24:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过一开始也没那么…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.03,1:24:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么难吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.78,1:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「BossRush感觉难顶」{\r}是哦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.14,1:24:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不弹反的话大概……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.01,1:24:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没法回血就糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.05,1:24:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,咚，好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.07,1:24:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.65,1:24:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.05,1:24:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.60,1:24:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还请不要踩我——
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.65,1:24:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好，不错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.12,1:25:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好，行
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.97,1:25:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.21,1:25:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.19,1:25:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好，好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.25,1:25:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.80,1:25:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错～
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.00,1:25:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,基本都回了，算是零伤害一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.78,1:25:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微摄水
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.92,1:25:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲一如既往的还是不收走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.55,1:25:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要扔玩具呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.06,1:26:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也不要就这么回去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.39,1:26:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫们也有点难对付呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.48,1:26:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.67,1:26:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧，猫猫们～
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.85,1:26:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一昧的用名为可爱的攻击来攻过来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.90,1:26:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗力相当高
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.77,1:26:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱，看这边了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.05,1:26:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,唉…好想变成蒲公英…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.30,1:26:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了，开始搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.92,1:26:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因为刚才那个霹雳舞
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.25,1:27:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.56,1:27:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,加油～
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.51,1:27:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.20,1:27:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.35,1:27:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.03,1:27:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.58,1:27:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙，挨了好多下
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.45,1:28:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸了。那里好难。再来再来再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.87,1:28:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吼难
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.49,1:28:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Rush 要从头开始……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.30,1:28:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.97,1:28:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.48,1:28:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.52,1:28:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.50,1:28:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好，好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.59,1:28:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.50,1:28:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.61,1:28:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒嗒，好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.11,1:28:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.58,1:28:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好，咚
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.61,1:28:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒，好，好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.59,1:29:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.70,1:29:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.62,1:29:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.27,1:29:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.49,1:29:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,忘记按了…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.75,1:29:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.85,1:29:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.82,1:29:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉可以
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.77,1:29:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,总之一阶段…不对
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.20,1:29:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个Boss
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.79,1:29:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,…宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.70,1:29:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.79,1:29:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是猫猫
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.30,1:29:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,问题在猫猫们，然后…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.32,1:29:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有大叔呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.03,1:29:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.77,1:30:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱的剪影呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.38,1:30:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,…痛
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.26,1:30:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.28,1:30:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,起风了…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.03,1:30:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.12,1:31:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.22,1:31:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才好点吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.00,1:31:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,勉强……勉强撑住了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.85,1:31:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴完全不行啊…不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.40,1:31:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,靠长按忍耐也算是一种战术啦…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.92,1:31:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但代价是槽掉了不少
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.06,1:31:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,得弹反才行
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.82,1:31:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就是大叔了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.34,1:32:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙——
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.89,1:32:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.11,1:32:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,咿——
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.87,1:32:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能撑住吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.22,1:32:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不弹…弹反的话，相当…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.91,1:32:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,咿——
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.31,1:32:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,二阶段……嘛会更难呢～
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.14,1:32:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,再来再来再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.30,1:33:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,超难捏…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.39,1:33:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.46,1:33:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.45,1:33:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.00,1:33:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好，好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.07,1:33:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.97,1:33:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点快了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.05,1:33:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,噔噔噔，好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.06,1:33:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,噔噔噔，好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.06,1:33:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.06,1:33:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,噔噔噔……
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.65,1:33:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.11,1:33:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.15,1:34:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.99,1:34:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.67,1:34:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是该稍微早一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.35,1:34:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好，宝宝桑…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.86,1:34:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,击退
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.07,1:34:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,猫桑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.92,1:34:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「靠弹反把伤害抵消了！」{\r}对只要能弹反到的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.07,1:34:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好，请多指教呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.16,1:34:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好，伤害还控制在最小程度
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.52,1:35:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来才开始
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.65,1:35:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要刮风了……
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.46,1:35:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,痛……
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.98,1:35:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还行还行还行还行
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.41,1:35:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还算可以吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.96,1:36:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才多留了点，接下来是大叔时间
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.74,1:36:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不算差
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.93,1:36:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不算差，留出了留出了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.90,1:36:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好，猫猫们，谢谢——
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.45,1:36:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.41,1:36:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔…！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.70,1:36:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,霹雳舞大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.40,1:36:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好，来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.69,1:36:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.37,1:36:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,痛诶……！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.35,1:37:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——绝妙——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.80,1:37:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,二周目来了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.99,1:37:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.63,1:37:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,呀——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.78,1:37:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,二阶段搞不懂啦——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.76,1:37:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,果然二阶段好难啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.58,1:37:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「打过别的之后就会忘记手感」{\r}忘记掉了！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.14,1:37:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,果然二周目还是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.23,1:37:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好，这个简单
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.76,1:38:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.29,1:38:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.80,1:38:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.03,1:38:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,弹反和完美判定没按出来的话……
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.75,1:38:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,会被狠削一下……
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.44,1:38:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,掉忍耐力
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.34,1:38:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.85,1:38:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,咚咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.33,1:38:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.36,1:38:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.56,1:38:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.85,1:38:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.96,1:38:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太早？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.86,1:38:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,……好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.88,1:38:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.55,1:38:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.02,1:39:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首先宝宝桑
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.61,1:39:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,击破
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.62,1:39:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,赢噜——
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.99,1:39:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rCHAT}「吸猫回血就行呢」{\r}确实
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.69,1:39:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,吸猫，来吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.08,1:39:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来了——猫猫们
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.42,1:39:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.83,1:39:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.16,1:39:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.47,1:39:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK～
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.09,1:39:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，起风了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.70,1:40:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.37,1:40:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.44,1:40:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有点……
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.61,1:40:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,晚了么……
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.83,1:40:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.91,1:40:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有点微妙看大叔发挥呢
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.11,1:41:05.86,CHAT,,0,0,0,,「为了保格挡得早按，早按就没弹反\N想弹反又会硬吃伤害…难度真是绝妙呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.00,1:41:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,完美判定真的很难，大概
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.62,1:41:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,确实……
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.70,1:41:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,……好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.84,1:41:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.95,1:41:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.57,1:41:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然吼难
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.86,1:41:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还算回了点……
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.41,1:41:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.80,1:41:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住了撑住了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.80,1:41:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,二阶段！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.06,1:41:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.10,1:42:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.47,1:42:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好……！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.09,1:42:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,完美——！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.03,1:42:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒了！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.30,1:42:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒了——！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.84,1:42:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来了——
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.42,1:42:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.18,1:42:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了——
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.67,1:42:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,做到了——
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.56,1:43:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲公英是不屈的……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.91,1:43:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,铃原露露也不屈露露！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.02,1:43:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不，说真的，还挺感人的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.69,1:43:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,内容上那个，非常……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.78,1:43:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感人的，虽说是个好游戏……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.35,1:43:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也有作为一般的…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.73,1:43:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,音游的难度还是有的ww
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.17,1:43:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很开心，虽然玩得热血上头了……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.34,1:43:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,撑下来了——鼠标也撑住了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.28,1:43:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你鼠标，一直陪着我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.84,1:43:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不惧雨
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.77,1:43:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不惧风
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.23,1:43:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雨的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.74,1:43:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,晴天也好，雨天也好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.59,1:43:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.15,1:43:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一起忍耐下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.74,1:43:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大家……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.17,1:43:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一起……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.69,1:43:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.42,1:43:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,忍着忍着
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.12,1:43:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐着
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.05,1:44:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后开花吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.78,1:44:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,总之这样……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.19,1:44:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我，也变成蒲公英了……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.47,1:44:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.27,1:44:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也算很能忍耐了吧，BossRush也
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.40,1:44:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那么各位，今天也感谢大家的观看
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.43,1:44:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,意外还挺健康的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.80,1:44:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢，各位
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.19,1:44:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.34,1:44:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家观看
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.03,1:44:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢——
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.70,1:44:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.12,1:44:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,下次
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.96,1:44:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,再会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.57,1:44:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,今天这一天……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.04,1:44:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微看看脚下的……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.94,1:44:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,花花草草之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.23,1:44:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,平时不留意的地方，也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.41,1:44:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.67,1:44:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.54,1:44:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再见啦——
